[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 15066.95, "timestamp": "04:11:06", "text": "等等，呃，二号？他们为什么失踪了？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15068.469, "timestamp": "04:11:08", "text": "为了让你相信他们是正规的？哦，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15078.07, "timestamp": "04:11:18", "text": "另外，谢谢你关注你好"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15080.469, "timestamp": "04:11:20", "text": "欢迎来到直播间。茉莉花萨玛"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15082.389, "timestamp": "04:11:22", "text": "来。抱歉让你们看到我这副样子"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15084.07, "timestamp": "04:11:24", "text": "这。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15087.14, "timestamp": "04:11:27", "text": "然后他们讲了个笑话。继续前行。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15095.91, "timestamp": "04:11:35", "text": "相信他们，因为他们会让你信服。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15098.229, "timestamp": "04:11:38", "text": "至少意味着音乐制作"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15101.11, "timestamp": "04:11:41", "text": "我正在参加的课程不是这样的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15104.71, "timestamp": "04:11:44", "text": "其实还不错，不过是啊，因为"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15107.269, "timestamp": "04:11:47", "text": "种子数量有限。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15109.59, "timestamp": "04:11:49", "text": "呃，我收到的东西太多了，我要……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15118.12, "timestamp": "04:11:58", "text": "我不知道"}]